Unprotected Admin Functionality
Summary

The admin panel is accessible without proper access control. A normal user can access the admin panel and delete another user.

Steps
Open /robots.txt and find the path to the admin panel.
Replace /robots.txt with /administrator-panel.
The admin panel loads without requiring admin privileges.
Delete the user carlos.
Impact

An attacker could access admin functionality and perform privileged actions, such as deleting users.

PoC
GET /administrator-panel HTTP/2

The admin panel is accessible to an unauthorized user.

Fix

Enforce server-side authorization checks on all admin endpoints and verify that the current user has the required privileges before allowing administrative actions.
